  "urpx:hasRatePlan": {
    "@type": "urpx:RatePlan",
    "@id": "jemc:qf",
    "urpx:name": "Schedule QF Qualifying Facilities Service",
    "urpx:ratePlanUniqueIdentifier": "QF",
    "urpx:initialEffectiveDate": "2022-01-01",
    "urpx:timezoneIdentifier": "America/New_York",
    "urpx:hasRatePlanVersion": {
      "@type": "urpx:RatePlanVersion",
      "@id": "jemc:qf-2022-01-01",
      "urpx:description": "Jackson EMC's qualifying facilities service schedule, QF-22. The monthly charge is the sum of an Energy Charge (EC) equal to total wholesale power costs, including base rate and delivery; a Facilities Charge (FC), one-twelfth of the annual allocated cost of providing service (operation and maintenance, customer accounting, customer service, sales, administrative and general, taxes, and allocated and direct plant capital costs); and a Margin Cost MC = 0.045 x TC + $50, where TC = EC + FC. Neither EC nor FC is published, so the JSON-LD defines each as a PriceDefinition with no Price, carries the Margin Cost's $50 as a monthly Price, and defines its 4.5 percent of TC as a PriceDefinition with no Price. Rates are set by the Cooperative's board, not the Georgia Public Service Commission; the sheet is effective January 1, 2022.",
      "urpx:effectiveDateTime": "2022-01-01T00:00:00",
      "urpx:changeReason": {
        "@id": "urpx:changeReasonOther"
      },
      "urpx:priceCurrency": "USD",
      "urpx:commodity": {
        "@id": "urpx:electricity"
      },
      "urpx:serviceRole": {
        "@id": "urpx:bundledServiceRole"
      },
      "urpx:customerChoice": {
        "@id": "urpx:voluntaryChoice"
      },
